hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"220","Saeed bin Abdul-Rahman Al-Makhzoumi narrated to us, Sufyan narrated to us, on the authority of Asim Al-Ahwal, who said: “If one of you wants to return, let him perform ablution.” His ablution is for prayer.” Meaning: the one who has intercourse and then comes back before he takes a bath."
